WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: 1-03 - Seconds Into Forever
NOTE Artist: The Stardust Engine
NOTE Album: Progress Street (2004)

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:29.500
[Instrumental Intro — Lush 1980s Synthesizer Pads & Clean Electric Guitar Arpeggios]

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:34.509
The clock is ticking on the classroom wall

00:00:34.509 --> 00:00:40.200
But time stands still here in the hall

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:45.500
I saw your face and the world went blurred

00:00:47.895 --> 00:00:54.200
The sweetest song that I ever heard

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:59.000
No need to run and no need to hide

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:02.708
I'm pulling up a chair right by your side

00:01:06.672 --> 00:01:11.500
They say that lightning strikes and then it's gone

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:16.500
But we're the glow before the dawn

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:21.500
Yeah, we're the light that's moving on!

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:27.000
It only takes three minutes to believe!

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:32.500
In the magic that we're starting to weave

00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:36.500
It's a heart-to-heart, it's a brand new start

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:40.500
Tearing the shadows of the night apart

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:44.000
Can you hear it? (I can hear it!)

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:47.500
Can you feel it? (I can feel it!)

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:51.000
It's seconds into forever!

00:01:51.000 --> 00:02:17.007
[Guitar Solo — Soaring Melodic Sustain]

00:02:17.007 --> 00:02:21.000
Seconds into forever...

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:32.000
[Outro — Sustained Synth Chord Fade]
